_refine.details                                  
;The second LD4 motif (chain F, bound to molecule C)    
was fitted into the unbiased   
3Fo-2Fc maps (CNS). Its position and orientation   
were inferred from homology with the   
well-defined other LD4 - FAT interaction (chains A and C),  
and are supported by NMR data(see publication).
;
